# Status labels

Follow `dotnet/docs/STATUS-VALUES.md`. Use these exact strings.

- DB Profile Status: `Active`, `Suspended`, `Expired on {date}`
- Commission Status: `Not Eligible`, `Eligible`, `Rejected`
- SB Payment Details: `Pending`, `Paid on {date}`, `Rejected`
- User Status: `Active`, `InActive`
- Document verification: `Not Submitted`, `Pending Review`, `Approved`, `Resubmission Required`, `Rejected`

`{date}` is the real date. Do not replace these with Success, Failed, Inactive, or Pending Payment.
